# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for running pulse jobs on backends from\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) has\n"
"been removed in Qiskit v1.0.  This is because Qiskit Aer removed its\n"
"simulation functionality for such jobs.  For low-level Hamiltonian-simulation\n"
"workloads, consider using a specialized library such as [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Podpora spouštění pulse úloh na Backendech z\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.fake_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_fake_provider) byla\n"
"v Qiskit v1.0 odstraněna. Důvodem je, že Qiskit Aer odstranil svou\n"
"simulační funkcionalitu pro takovéto úlohy. Pro nízkoúrovňové workloady\n"
"hamiltonovské simulace zvaž použití specializované knihovny, jako je [Qiskit\n"
"Dynamics](https://qiskit-extensions.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/).\n"

