msgstr "jupyter {#jupyter}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.jupyter` submodule has been removed because the functionality\n"
"in this module is tied to the legacy `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package, which is no\n"
"longer supported. It also only supported `BackendV1` and not the newer\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface.\n"
msgstr ""
"Submodul `qiskit.tools.jupyter` byl odstraněn, protože jeho funkcionalita\n"
"je svázána se starším balíčkem `qiskit-ibmq-provider`, který již není\n"
"podporován. Také podporoval pouze `BackendV1`, nikoli novější\n"
"rozhraní [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
