#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"monitor\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"monitor\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "monitor {#monitor}"
msgstr "monitor {#monitor}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.monitor` submodule has been removed as it was tied to the\n"
"legacy `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package, which is no longer supported (it also\n"
"only supported `BackendV1` interface and not the newer\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface). There is\n"
"no alternative provided for this functionality.\n"
msgstr ""
"Submodul `qiskit.tools.monitor` byl odstraněn, protože byl svázán se\n"
"starším balíčkem `qiskit-ibmq-provider`, který již není podporován (také\n"
"podporoval pouze rozhraní `BackendV1`, nikoli novější\n"
"rozhraní [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)). Pro tuto funkcionalitu\n"
"není k dispozici žádná náhrada.\n"

